## Operational checklist

- Assign a stable revision ID to every production prompt.
- Record the intent and risk of a proposed change.
- Review changed instructions and tool policies together.
- Compare variants on representative scenarios.
- Attribute production runs to the released revision.
- Practice rollback before the change is urgent.

